<!-- Launcher foreground: three route lines (red / blue / yellow); the blue middle
     line converges into a black forward arrow (rounded tail, same height as the
     line, no gap) that reads against the white icon background. Reused as the
     monochrome layer — that layer is drawn as a single-tint silhouette, so the
     arrow's own color doesn't affect it, and the arrowhead extending past the bar
     ends keeps the silhouette distinct. Centered in the 72dp adaptive-icon safe
     zone. -->
